# Staff

Admin CRUD is one controller, `StaffUserController`, keyed by slug: `approvers`, `lawyers`, `counselors`, `law-enforcers`, `humanitarians`.

Profile image is `users.image_path` on the `public` disk (`staff/`). Use `User::imageUrl()`. Delete the file when replacing or deleting the user.

Assigned roles (lawyer, counselor, law enforcer, humanitarian) share `AssignedComplaintController`. Visibility is the matching `assigned_to_*` column. Do not show unassigned complaints.

Public `/team` and user `/my/directory` both list active staff via `staff-card`. Team shows image, name, role. Directory also shows contact fields.

Help requested (`help_requested_*`) is not the same as assignment (`assigned_to_*`). Only admin sets assignment, at publish or later via `updateAssignments`.
